{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8f3d6006945d280ae56","chatId":"95f9c617d0c3421ba67c04ea475bbd9e","sessionId":null,"userId":69535,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1049,"promptTokens":1484,"completionTokens":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:59"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004608051199457077,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8f3d6006945d280ae54","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369779989,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:59","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8f3d6006945d280ae54","chatId":"95f9c617d0c3421ba67c04ea475bbd9e","sessionId":null,"userId":69535,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n奥利弗正在拜访他刚刚搬了新家的朋友托马斯。托马斯为自己现代化的家感到自豪，他带奥利弗参观了整个房子，最后介绍了他的新智能家居系统。奥利弗并不精通技术，他不禁表示这一切看起来都很复杂，并大声问道，为什么会有人需要这么多看起来几乎没有必要的功能。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，托马斯最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 气恼\nB) 自豪\nC) 开心\nD) 失望\nE) 娱乐\nF) 期待\n\n## 问题 2\n托马斯为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 他的朋友对他觉得兴奋不已的房子不以为然\nB) 他不在乎奥利弗的评论\nC) 奥利弗也为他的房子感到兴奋\nD) 他的房子比奥利弗的房子好太多了","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004608051199457077,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8f3d6006945d280ae56","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369779987,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:59","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"8a4e4b9f2d574862a4c7dd69d70c9435"}